<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>FEM (<math id="S3.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math>) / LLM-as-Judge (<math id="S3.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math>) accuracy for various representations using Llama 3.1 8B. Best in <span id="S3.T3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>.</figcaption>
