</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1.i7" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"> 
<span id="A2.I1.i7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[00:48]</span><span id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">B</span><span id="A2.I1.i7.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: There are two beds. with a purplish mattress, and a biege comforter across each</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1.i8" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"> 
<span id="A2.I1.i8.p1" class="ltx_para">
