<div id="A4.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The Script Creator systematically introduces complexity to the dialog (i.e., noticing similarities, addressing ambiguities, etc.) This includes generating sentences that reference objects seen by the other navigator (indirect reference) or that require a deeper understanding of the shared context.</p>
</div>
